          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Value domain for substantive or sentinel values for a variable. Typically a description and/or enumeration of allowed values of interest. CDIF profile of the DDI-CDI ValueDomain — a single node is either a cdif:SubstantiveValueDomain (subject-matter values) or a cdif:SentinelValueDomain (processing/missing-value codes).
:title: "CDIF Value Domain"
:union: ``oneOf``</body>
