          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Specification of possible sentinel values used by a variable. Sentinel values are special values used to indicate various invalid conditions for a variable, e.g. below detection, missing value.
:idDescription: "Identifier for this SentinelValueDomain node"
:rdfType: ``cdif:SentinelValueDomain``
:choiceConstraints:
- ``cdif:takesValuesFrom | cdif:recommendedDataType``
:exportedDef:</body>
