            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

A logical expression where the values of "x" making the expression true are the members of the set of valid values. For example, "(all reals x such that x &gt; 0)" describes the real numbers greater than 0.
:jsonName: "cdif:logicalExpression"</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifValueDomain.ValueAndConceptDescription.cdif_logicalExpression"/>
